## 3. Prebuilt binaries (Windows)

### `bin/windows/` — solver binaries

Six executables built by this project from the LGPL-3.0 sources above:

```
PIV.exe  transf_a.exe  ortho_plan.exe  vel_transf.exe  filter.exe  vel_scal.exe
```

They are covered by **LGPL-3.0**. Corresponding source is
`tools/solver-patches/`. Build instructions: `docs/BUILDING.md`.
`filter.exe` is built with `kdtree2.f90`, which remains under AFL-1.1
(`LICENSE.kdtree2-AFL-1.1`).

### FFmpeg

FFmpeg and ffprobe are not included. Users install a build separately and are
responsible for following its license terms. The driver locates both programs on
`PATH`; see https://ffmpeg.org/download.html.

