## 4. The Fudaa-LSPIV GUI

`LSPIV_Edge` does not include or link against the Fudaa-LSPIV GUI. That GUI is
separate software under **GPL-2.0**:

> https://gitlab.com/fudaa/fudaa-lspiv

The user manual is https://gitlab.com/fudaa/fudaa-lspiv/-/wikis/home.
The project page is
https://riverhydraulics.riverly.inrae.fr/eng/tools/measurement-software/fudaa-lspiv.

You need the GUI once, to produce the calibration files for a new measurement site.
It is not needed at run time.

